  "details": "Currently, when a Physbone is stretched, it stretches the whole bone when pulled. When using squish, one expects the whole chain to be squished (similar to an accordion). However, Physbone squishes one bone at a time in sequence. This causes issues for for any component that includes more than one bone. My suggestion is to either change or add a toggle to enable squish as a percentage of the whole chain vs the current functionality.",
